{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Jumping World Cup takes players to the world\u2019s most iconic ski jumping hills, offering competition in both single player modes and online matches against opponents from around the globe. Feel the adrenaline of ski jumping as you compete on 18 varied hills, take part in World Cup, or create your own tournament tailored to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.poster.avif?t=1771535099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.webm?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.mp4?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself in competitive tournaments, sharpen your technique in practice mode, or challenge players worldwide in thrilling online duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision. Nerves. Flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ski Jumping World Cup - where every jump matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.poster.avif?t=1771535099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.webm?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.mp4?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied gameplay modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Start with the tutorial, refine your skills in training mode, then show your full potential in World Cup competitions or create your own tournament featuring selected hills and a custom number of participants.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 hills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete on the most recognizable ski jumping venues, including 5 illuminated hills available in an additional night mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control your jumper during flight, fight the wind and aim for the best results.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge other players in online multiplayer or in the classic hot seat mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic weather, realistic wind conditions, and detailed visuals recreate the intensity and beauty of ski jumping.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gravity Wins Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"Telemark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"Not This Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"Hundred Smooth Landings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the Training Hill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"K-Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/53729708734bf2d4d8ad9af72c3d008daa8483a0.jpg"},{"name":"Globetrotter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"First Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/2f8df9dd30ba3d7c77c134853c12e103396b7832.jpg"},{"name":"Serial Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/53729708734bf2d4d8ad9af72c3d008daa8483a0.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3985400/9f59493db4f309c7effee65725d5c032c286a05b.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985400?t=1771535099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985400?t=1771535099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/9ae9f505dec0ba4b0d3e9d01e6f2e086f2412676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771535099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/9ae9f505dec0ba4b0d3e9d01e6f2e086f2412676/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771535099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join The Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/d226a08c0505565dfae0ca0e0111fc2b.avif?t=1771535099\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Jumping World Cup takes players to the world\u2019s most iconic ski jumping hills, offering competition in both single player modes and online matches against opponents from around the globe. Feel the adrenaline of ski jumping as you compete on 18 varied hills, take part in World Cup, or create your own tournament tailored to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.poster.avif?t=1771535099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.webm?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.mp4?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself in competitive tournaments, sharpen your technique in practice mode, or challenge players worldwide in thrilling online duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision. Nerves. Flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ski Jumping World Cup - where every jump matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.poster.avif?t=1771535099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.webm?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.mp4?t=1771535099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied gameplay modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Start with the tutorial, refine your skills in training mode, then show your full potential in World Cup competitions or create your own tournament featuring selected hills and a custom number of participants.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 hills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete on the most recognizable ski jumping venues, including 5 illuminated hills available in an additional night mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control your jumper during flight, fight the wind and aim for the best results.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge other players in online multiplayer or in the classic hot seat mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic weather, realistic wind conditions, and detailed visuals recreate the intensity and beauty of ski jumping.</i></p>","developers":["Storm Trident S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/1d6416a136f08f4cee9225d84